              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Daudi yirana mu lidaala lia Zikilaga, yatuma kidieli kilala chi vilaanye via yanyoora ku avalina veve, aviimiliri vi Ivuyuda, na makuva, “Ngiki kihanwa ku munyi kutura ku vilaanye via kwavugula kutura ku vasigu va Yahova.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
